# Line-ending normalisation.
#
# WHY: ARCHITECTURE.md invariant 5 requires that re-indexing an unchanged commit
#      produces a byte-identical pack, and VALIDATION.md section 4 failure 10
#      names non-deterministic output as the failure that kills the review
#      culture. A repository that stores CRLF on Windows and LF elsewhere cannot
#      make either claim -- golden-file diffs would be full of invisible noise
#      and reviewers would learn to ignore them.
#
# Everything is LF in the repository, on every platform.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.sqlite binary
